<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 64 0 R
/E (The cleaned datasets were imported into Power BI to create interactive EV Market Intelligence and Global EV Charging Infrastructure dashboards. KPI cards and visualizations are used to analyze EV models, manufacturers, battery capacity, driving range, energy efficiency, vehicle types, charging power, charging stations, charging ports, fast DC charging, and the geographical distribution of charging infrastructure. Interactive slicers are also provided for vehicle and charging-related categories to support detailed analysis and comparison.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
