<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 65 0 R
/E (The project successfully transforms raw electric vehicle and charging infrastructure data into a cleaned analytical dataset using Python and presents the resulting insights through interactive Power BI and Tableau dashboards. The project provides a comprehensive view of EV market trends, vehicle performance, battery characteristics, charging capabilities, and the geographical distribution of charging infrastructure. The visualizations help in understanding EV manufacturers, driving range, energy efficiency, charging station distribution, charging power, and fast DC charging patterns.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
